+
+Renaming a user (`PUT /orgs/{orgID}/users/{uid}`) changes the user's ID everywhere it is referenced: project memberships and task assignees move to the new ID. The old ID stops working (401), and the new ID works with `X-User` immediately. Example:
+
+```sh
+curl -X PUT -H 'X-User: eve' -d '{"id":"benjamin"}' localhost:8080/orgs/acme/users/ben
+curl -H 'X-User: benjamin' localhost:8080/projects/web/tasks
+```
 
